    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8908" root="حلك" body-key="H">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلَكَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلُكَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُلُوكَةٌ</span> (S, Sgh, TA)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُلُوكٌ</span>; (Sgh, TA;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلِكَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلَكَ</span></b> , (K,
TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلَكٌ</span>; (K, * TK;) the former verb
strangely overlooked by F; (TA;) <i>It</i> (a thing,
S) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, intensely black;</i> (S, Sgh, K;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِحْلَوْلَكَ</span></b> . (S, TA.)

